@startuml
title 短锁方案与全业务锁对比

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor A
actor B
participant "DistributedLock" as LOCK
database "Idempotency DB" as DB
participant "Business" as BIZ

== 推荐：短锁 ==
A -> LOCK : lock
A -> DB : tryAcquire -> PROCESSING(A,v1)
DB --> A : ACQUIRED
A -> LOCK : unlock
A -> BIZ : long business 10s

B -> LOCK : lock
B -> DB : tryAcquire
DB --> B : PROCESSING_ACTIVE(A,v1)
B -> LOCK : unlock
B <-- DB : 可立即知道“正在处理”

...10s...
A -> DB : markSuccess(A,v1)

== 不推荐：锁包完整业务 ==
A -> LOCK : lock
A -> DB : tryAcquire -> PROCESSING
A -> BIZ : long business 10s
B -> LOCK : wait / timeout
note right of B
B 先被锁挡住，
看不到 DB 中的 PROCESSING，
请求等待时间被业务耗时放大。
end note
A -> DB : markSuccess
A -> LOCK : unlock
B -> LOCK : finally acquire
B -> DB : query SUCCESS

note bottom
全业务锁还会引入：lease/watchdog、GC 暂停、锁丢失后旧执行者继续运行等问题。
因此 Lock 只能是并发收敛层，State 才是正确性核心。
end note

@enduml
